# descent-vk gunner_missile: the gunner with its missile pod, as ONE mesh.
# For the level editor's preview and the level's placement proxy only. The game
# draws a gunner_missile as gunner.obj plus missile_pod.obj, separately, because
# the pod can be shot off. This file is those two put together - gunner.obj's
# vertices and faces unchanged, then missile_pod.obj's moved by the mount - so a
# change to either belongs in both.
# THIS MESH MUST STAY CLOSED. It is the gunner's closed shells plus the pod's
# closed shells at AttachmentDef::mount (1.3, 2.05, 0.0), sharing no vertex.
#
# -Z is forward. Wound counter-clockwise seen from outside; normals are not
# authored, the loader computes flat per-face normals.

